stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Lobby
    Lobby --> Ready: choose mode and start
    Ready --> Racing: START RACE
    Racing --> Paused: pause button / P / blur / resize
    Paused --> Racing: resume exact state
    Paused --> Racing: restart current level
    Racing --> Failed: off road or timer expires
    Failed --> Racing: TRY AGAIN / Space in keyboard mode
    Racing --> LevelComplete: checkpoints complete before final level
    LevelComplete --> Racing: NEXT LEVEL
    Racing --> ChampionshipComplete: final configured level complete
    ChampionshipComplete --> Racing: RACE AGAIN from level one
    Ready --> Lobby: return
    Paused --> Lobby: return
    Failed --> Lobby: return
    LevelComplete --> Lobby: return
    ChampionshipComplete --> Lobby: return
    note right of Lobby
        Highest unlocked level persists in session.
        Restart and race again never lower it.
    end note
